{"id": "86335", "name": "אינטגרל של sinh(ax−b) – הצבה לינארית (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Evaluate the following integral, using a substitution if necessary:</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int \\sinh({{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}-{{CT:2}})d{{CT:1}} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">A linear substitution</b><br><p>Using a substitution, let</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ u={{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}-{{CT:2}} \\]</p><p>Differentiating \\(u\\) with respect to {{CT:3}} gives</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ du={{CT:0}}d{{CT:1}} \\]</p><p>Therefore</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int \\sinh({{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}-{{CT:2}})\\ d{{CT:1}} =\\int \\frac{1}{{CT:0}}\\sinh(u)du \\]</p><p>The integral of sinh is cosh giving</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int \\frac{1}{{CT:0}}\\sinh(u)du = \\frac{1}{{CT:0}}\\cosh({{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}-{{CT:2}}) + c \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpar